<title>INDIA: Hijacked Indian plane heading to Delhi - police.</title>
<headline>Hijacked Indian plane heading to Delhi - police.</headline>
<dateline>JAMMU, India 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>A hijacked Indian airplane was returning to the capital New Delhi on Thursday after Pakistani authorities refused to allow it to land, police said.</p>
</text>
